# Planted at initialization with <owners> and <service> substituted; fork-owned from then on.
# The Default Branch Protection ruleset requires a code-owner review on main. Every area lists
# the same owners until a fork splits them; the sections document the ownership seam
# (upstream, template, fork) so a split is a one-value edit. Last match wins.

# Upstream-owned shared code. A change here is a port (ADR-038); the owner's review is the check.
*                               <owners>

# Engineering system, synced from the template.
/.github/                       <owners>
/build/                         <owners>
/.release-please-config.json    <owners>

# Fork-owned Azure source, descriptor, and filter config.
/provider/<service>-azure/      <owners>
/testing/<service>-test-azure/  <owners>
/.spi/                          <owners>
/.github/upstream-filter.yml    <owners>
/.github/CODEOWNERS             <owners>
